-- Registry in demos/registries/ (relative-path form). Twin of r2-central.bqn.
-- Same program and world as r1-beside, but the fixture lives in the shared demos/registries/
-- directory instead of beside the twin. The twin reaches it by a path relative to itself.
-- This is the layout every other demo uses; r1-beside shows the fixture may equally sit next
-- to its program. Bare name -> beside the .ano; relative path -> from the .ano; absolute -> verbatim.
--! registry ../registries/r2-central.reg
--! expect hp = 110 100 110

Alive , Hp += 10
